# Free LLM Gateway — VektorFlow Provider Gateway

A clean, deployment-ready OpenAI-compatible multi-provider LLM gateway.

## Purpose

This gateway provides a unified API interface for connecting applications and AI agents to multiple LLM providers.

It is designed to work with VektorFlow while remaining platform-agnostic.

## Security

This repository contains no provider API keys, passwords, tokens, or private credentials.

Provider credentials must be supplied through environment variables or the deployment platform's secret-management system.

Never commit `.env` files or real API credentials to this repository.

## Deployment

The gateway can be deployed as a web service on platforms such as Render.

Configure provider credentials as environment variables in the deployment platform.

